Source: raskolnikov
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Raskolnikov Security Team
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, dh-cargo
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/dysshanks/Raskolnikov

Package: raskolnikov
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nmap, gobuster, nikto, sqlmap
Description: Terminal-native AI security operating environment
 Raskolnikov is a terminal-native, markdown-driven AI security
 operating environment for authorised penetration testing and CTF
 competitions. It provides an interactive TUI with AI-powered analysis,
 tool integration, and session management.
 .
 Supports multiple AI providers: Ollama (local), Anthropic, OpenAI,
 Groq, OpenRouter, Nous Research, Llama API, and Together AI.
